      "text": "Joseph … whose branches run over the wall, Gen. 49:22. I have run through a troop, 2 Sam. 22:30 (Ps. 18:29). Elijah … ran before Ahab to the entrance, 1 Kgs. 18:46. my cup runneth over, Ps. 23:5. their feet run to evil, Prov. 1:16 (Isa. 59:7). when thou runnest, thou shalt not stumble, Prov. 4:12. they shall run, and not be weary, Isa. 40:31 (D&C 89:20). nations that knew not thee shall run unto thee, Isa. 55:5. Run ye … through the streets of Jerusalem, Jer. 5:1. many shall run to and fro, Dan. 12:4. they shall run to and fro to seek the word of the Lord, Amos 8:12.",
